  "details": "A new system that allows stuff to attach to other people or world.\n\nMagnets are able to attract to or repel from other magnets within the radius and the force increase the closer it comes. \n\nMagnet component options:\n\nMagnetic pole (positive or negative)\n\nMagnetic Strength\n\nRadius\n\nTag (pole option to positive or negative)\n\nColliders (pole option to positive or negative)\n\n(bool) Locked  animateable -> allows to stick to the same magnet and move.\n\nAnimator Parameters:\n\nbool isAttached \n\nbool Magnetic_Force (the strength of the force of the 2 magnets -> this also be -1, if 2 of same poles get close)\n\nbool Magnetic_Distance (distance from other magnet)\n\nMagnets can be attracted to any other magnet or by the default colliders like hand, fingers and head.\n\nSince Magnets won't move on themself towards other magnets maybe add them to physics bones or addon for physicsbones that bones get deformed if there is a magnet on any of children\n\nBut having a way to attract object from other avatar or connect them and do animation stuff because of it.\n\nIt can be used for to make props that can stay on other people avatar. Or drop them in the world. \n\nThere so many more possibilities with interacting with world and other avatars.",
